  72:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****     (#) Enable the ADC interface
  73:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****         (++) As prerequisite, ADC clock must be configured at RCC top level.
