  80:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                    or asynchronous clock derived from system clock or PLL (output divider P)
  81:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                    running up to 75MHz.
  82:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
