 265:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      By default, after the @ref HAL_ADC_Init() and when the state is @ref HAL_ADC_STATE_RESET
 266:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      all callbacks are set to the corresponding weak functions:
