 268:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      Exception done for MspInit and MspDeInit functions that are
 269:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      reset to the legacy weak functions in the @ref HAL_ADC_Init()/ @ref HAL_ADC_DeInit() only when
 270:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      these callbacks are null (not registered beforehand).
