 695:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** /**
 696:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @brief  Deinitialize the ADC peripheral registers to their default reset
 697:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         values, with deinitialization of the ADC MSP.
 698:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @note   For devices with several ADCs: reset of ADC common registers is done
 699:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         only if all ADCs sharing the same common group are disabled.
 700:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         (function "HAL_ADC_MspDeInit()" is also called under the same conditions:
 701:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         all ADC instances use the same core clock at RCC level, disabling
 702:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         the core clock reset all ADC instances).
